{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的高亮词虽然是短语，但能串起从想靠近、怕给对方负担，到期待互相依靠、担心失去亲近、最后接受不确定性的过程，人物此刻的处境比较清楚；small：Y 的补充能提供具体的关系细节和身体感受，与大字衔接较好，不读也基本不妨碍理解。core：X 更持续地围绕亲近带来的幸福与无法留住它的痛楚展开，Y 后半段有些转向害怕被嫌弃、害怕不再被需要；concise：X 的大小字多次重复同一感受，例如失重、酸楚、无法满足等，Y 虽然也有重复，但重复往往推动关系认识发生变化；human：Y 的日常口语更自然，X 有“让这份舒服抵达什么结果”“它本身有更宽的分量”等生硬、抽象的搭配。fine：X 的第一人称体验和身体感受意象更细腻，像“动作先露出了害怕”“眼前的好还在却已经有点鼻酸”，辨识度较高；load：Y 每屏高亮短语较短，数量与停留时间基本相称，X 则有不少较长的大字块，扫读负担更重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eefab1ce-ec1c-41ed-a217-9cb7af464c04", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T150749992921Z", "elapsed_seconds": 277.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:12:27.363539+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2732a17c8493e4e68b57b3fa0c612a32c6258d5c91b35c6227392e1e26e695f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6